{"3684530":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"PlinkIdle","steam_appid":3684530,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<h1>Feature List<\/h1><p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thematic stages<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Incremental progression<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lucky buffs, drops, and spawns<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrades<\/p><\/li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prestige and achievements<\/p><\/li><\/ul><\/p><br><h1>About the Game<\/h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3684530\/extras\/165b378cc03feb5032b72500e038de91.avif?t=1793764655\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3684530\/extras_big\/165b378cc03feb5032b72500e038de91.webp?t=1793764655 width=1560 height=189 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3684530\/extras\/682e1ecd7cecbd62be7eaf434bf2c375.poster.avif?t=1793764655\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3684530\/extras\/682e1ecd7cecbd62be7eaf434bf2c375.webm?t=1793764655\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3684530\/extras\/682e1ecd7cecbd62be7eaf434bf2c375.mp4?t=1793764655\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It begins with a single drop. Then another. And another. Before long, you're deep in ever-expanding, ever growing chaos, in a deluge of balls, coins, upgrades, buffs, multipliers, and more.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3684530\/extras\/89b05be5e9663edc0164c47d67c075bb.avif?t=1793764655\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3684530\/extras_big\/89b05be5e9663edc0164c47d67c075bb.webp?t=1793764655 width=1560 height=189 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3684530\/extras\/64659dd17fc4f90b4d5200282847062a.poster.avif?t=1793764655\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3684530\/extras\/64659dd17fc4f90b4d5200282847062a.webm?t=1793764655\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3684530\/extras\/64659dd17fc4f90b4d5200282847062a.mp4?t=1793764655\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the ball-o-meters fill, new stages are unlock with scenic pixel art backdrops to set the mood. Collect every cozy, moody theme as you advance through the game.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3684530\/extras\/7e5630bdc8c44cdcd6f305d8aa459d4b.avif?t=1793764655\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3684530\/extras_big\/7e5630bdc8c44cdcd6f305d8aa459d4b.webp?t=1793764655 width=1560 height=189 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3684530\/extras\/59a15e1a3d6bd5913672ade848ce9fc2.poster.avif?t=1793764655\" width=960 height=240 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3684530\/extras\/59a15e1a3d6bd5913672ade848ce9fc2.webm?t=1793764655\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3684530\/extras\/59a15e1a3d6bd5913672ade848ce9fc2.mp4?t=1793764655\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fine tune the audio in settings to get the ASMR juuuuuust right. This game is a rain machine, with an atmospheric chiptunes soundtrack to help set the mood.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3684530\/extras\/3bc9d9aaf9c51a3f3dbf8bf61aceffcb.avif?t=1793764655\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3684530\/extras_big\/3bc9d9aaf9c51a3f3dbf8bf61aceffcb.webp?t=1793764655 width=1560 height=189 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3684530\/extras\/22ad7d986abee5a12696c28e7215d74d.poster.avif?t=1793764655\" width=960 height=240 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3684530\/extras\/22ad7d986abee5a12696c28e7215d74d.webm?t=1793764655\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3684530\/extras\/22ad7d986abee5a12696c28e7215d74d.mp4?t=1793764655\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game progresses, you can hone your playstyle with passive or active choices. Rombo the Autobot will do some work for you if you want to step away, or you can invest in combos, GoldCoins, and Disco balls for enhanced multipliers in active play.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3684530\/extras\/b369a268b375fa4575036ea517c76bed.avif?t=1793764655\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3684530\/extras_big\/b369a268b375fa4575036ea517c76bed.webp?t=1793764655 width=1560 height=189 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3684530\/extras\/3dd181150d286e40e6ceb52a893f704a.poster.avif?t=1793764655\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3684530\/extras\/3dd181150d286e40e6ceb52a893f704a.webm?t=1793764655\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3684530\/extras\/3dd181150d286e40e6ceb52a893f704a.mp4?t=1793764655\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prestige lets you change how you play each run, with continuous rewards as you reach greater milestones. Every rank makes you more powerful, blasting through the early stages and reaching greater heights.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sit back, hit the &quot;drop&quot; button, and let the chaos begin.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3684530\/extras\/165b378cc03feb5032b72500e038de91.avif?t=1793764655\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3684530\/extras_big\/165b378cc03feb5032b72500e038de91.webp?t=1793764655 width=1560 height=189 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"b