ass=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3684530\/extras\/22ad7d986abee5a12696c28e7215d74d.poster.avif?t=1793764655\" width=960 height=240 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3684530\/extras\/22ad7d986abee5a12696c28e7215d74d.webm?t=1793764655\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3684530\/extras\/22ad7d986abee5a12696c28e7215d74d.mp4?t=1793764655\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game progresses, you can hone your playstyle with passive or active choices. Rombo the Autobot will do some work for you if you want to step away, or you can invest in combos, GoldCoins, and Disco balls for enhanced multipliers in active play.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3684530\/extras\/b369a268b375fa4575036ea517c76bed.avif?t=1793764655\" data-big-src=https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3684530\/extras_big\/b369a268b375fa4575036ea517c76bed.webp?t=1793764655 width=1560 height=189 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3684530\/extras\/3dd181150d286e40e6ceb52a893f704a.poster.avif?t=1793764655\" width=1170 height=292 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3684530\/extras\/3dd181150d286e40e6ceb52a893f704a.webm?t=1793764655\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3684530\/extras\/3dd181150d286e40e6ceb52a893f704a.mp4?t=1793764655\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prestige lets you change how you play each run, with continuous rewards as you reach greater milestones. Every rank makes you more powerful, blasting through the early stages and reaching greater heights.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sit back, hit the &quot;drop&quot; button, and let the chaos begin.<\/p>","short_description":"PlinkIdle is a retro-inspired game with an idle\/incremental spin on a classic ball drop mechanic. Falling balls, rare buffs, and steady upgrades unlock colorful, cozy stages and immersive environments.","supported_languages":"English, German, Japanese, Korean, Simplified Chinese, Thai, Traditional Chinese, Russian, Spanish - Latin America, Portuguese - Brazil","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3684530\/c49b8263847094c3788f12d242149610e85cb907\/header.jpg?t=1793764655","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3684530\/b897371ecc827c6f97645bd8d75ffce7fc7c2d30\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793764655","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3684530\/b897371ecc827c6f97645bd8d75ffce7fc7c2d30\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793764655","website":"https:\/\/www.black-heart.games\/plinkidle","pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/li><li><strong>OS:<\/strong> Windows 10, 11 x64<br><\/li><li><strong>Processor:<\/strong> Intel Core i3<br><\/li><li><strong>Memory:<\/strong> 1 GB RAM<br><\/li><li><strong>Graphics:<\/strong> OpenGL 2.1 compatible graphics card, integrated graphics<br><\/li><li><strong>Storage:<\/strong> 300 MB available space<\/li><\/ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<